WEBVTT

00:00:26.480 --> 00:00:28.200
Queen's Blade.

00:00:28.200 --> 00:00:34.370
This is a ritual of the gods, used to determine the strongest and most beautiful Queen.

00:00:34.690 --> 00:00:36.820
The one who is worthy to be Queen...

00:00:36.820 --> 00:00:40.390
This is something that won't be determined until they battle.

00:00:41.480 --> 00:00:47.900
kagata kure hikaru yo mayoi wo uchi keshite

00:00:41.480 --> 00:00:47.900
かがたくれ光るよ迷いを打ち消し

00:00:41.480 --> 00:00:47.900
The blazing light will chase the doubts away

00:00:48.150 --> 00:00:56.620
yowake ga kuru no nara osorezuni kono DOOR wo hirakao

00:00:48.150 --> 00:00:56.620
よわけが来るのなら恐れ済みこのドアを平子

00:00:48.150 --> 00:00:56.620
And when the dawn comes the door will open

00:01:06.960 --> 00:01:12.620
Moshimo itsuka hohoende kureru hi ga kuru nara

00:01:06.960 --> 00:01:12.620
もしもいつか微笑んでくれる日がくるなら

00:01:06.960 --> 00:01:12.620
If there ever comes a day where you can smile

00:01:13.170 --> 00:01:19.140
sore wa kitto nani ka ga kawatte shunkan

00:01:13.170 --> 00:01:19.140
それはきっと何かが変わって瞬間

00:01:13.170 --> 00:01:19.140
Something will definitely change in that moment

00:01:19.430 --> 00:01:24.810
tsuyoku naritai no negau yori mo ima wa

00:01:19.430 --> 00:01:24.810
強くなりたいの願うよりも今は

00:01:19.430 --> 00:01:24.810
It is now my wish to become strong

00:01:25.770 --> 00:01:31.440
tada tsuyoku naru no ka watashi dake ga moteru

00:01:25.770 --> 00:01:31.440
ただ強くならのか私だけが持てる

00:01:25.770 --> 00:01:31.440
Is becoming strong all that I can hope for?

00:01:31.530 --> 00:01:37.610
kotae wo shiritai

00:01:31.530 --> 00:01:37.610
答えを知りたい

00:01:31.530 --> 00:01:37.610
I want to know the answer

00:01:37.910 --> 00:01:44.500
kagata kure hikaru yo mayoi wo uchikeshite

00:01:37.910 --> 00:01:44.500
かがたくれ光るよ迷いを打ち消し

00:01:37.910 --> 00:01:44.500
The blazing light will chase the doubts away

00:01:44.830 --> 00:01:50.750
omoi de bakari wo nazoru dake ja naku

00:01:44.830 --> 00:01:50.750
重いでばかりを謎るだけじゃなく

00:01:44.830 --> 00:01:50.750
My feelings do nothing but puzzle me

00:01:50.920 --> 00:01:56.930
kore kara kaerareru mirai ga hajimaru

00:01:50.920 --> 00:01:56.930
是から帰られる未来が始まる

00:01:50.920 --> 00:01:56.930
From now on I will change, my future is beginning

00:01:57.130 --> 00:02:07.030
yoake ga kuru no nara osorezuni kono DOOR wo hiraka wo

00:01:57.130 --> 00:02:07.030
夜明けが来るのなら恐れずにこのドアを平鹿

00:01:57.130 --> 00:02:07.030
And when the dawn comes, the door will open

00:02:18.070 --> 00:02:19.030
Um...

00:02:19.420 --> 00:02:23.610
Since the last customer just left, and we haven't cleaned the room yet,

00:02:23.610 --> 00:02:28.330
we will not charge inn expenses for the Lady General's room.

00:02:30.540 --> 00:02:32.090
Please have a nice rest.

00:02:49.240 --> 00:02:51.140
The maid is the one who should be doing this...

00:02:51.540 --> 00:02:57.070
It is not befitting of a noble to show a disorderly bed to a commoner.

00:02:57.820 --> 00:02:58.910
I understand...

00:03:00.110 --> 00:03:03.820
Leina, the day you become the Countess will eventually arrive.

00:03:04.590 --> 00:03:06.330
It would be better if you were the heiress.

00:03:13.540 --> 00:03:16.790
Onee-sama~.

00:03:19.660 --> 00:03:22.090
That was such a cute little birdy...

00:03:22.090 --> 00:03:24.180
I teased her to my heart's content.

00:03:24.330 --> 00:03:27.010
I was mistaken to have trusted a mercenary.

00:03:27.010 --> 00:03:29.750
That tone of yours is making me shiver...

00:03:31.660 --> 00:03:33.440
Wouldn't you like to hire me?

00:03:33.730 --> 00:03:34.940
What nonsense are you spewing...

00:03:35.260 --> 00:03:37.500
Take this scenario, for example:

00:03:37.500 --> 00:03:42.400
The traveling girl who ran away from home had an unfortunate accident and lost her life.

00:03:43.050 --> 00:03:45.870
Who do you think would become the next Countess, then?

00:03:49.910 --> 00:03:53.040
You let Leina go for something like that?

00:03:55.720 --> 00:03:59.300
While I was with her in the ring, it dawned on me.

00:03:59.670 --> 00:04:04.130
If you became the Countess, you wouldn't be able to bear the thought of me going unrewarded.

00:04:06.550 --> 00:04:11.100
Skill with the sword, education, refinement, courage, popularity...

00:04:11.100 --> 00:04:13.390
You are above her in all of these aspects.

00:04:13.390 --> 00:04:14.560
But you aren't a legitimate child...

00:04:15.520 --> 00:04:19.270
For this reason alone, you are a flower withering in the shadows.

00:04:19.900 --> 00:04:21.800
Can you be satisfied...

00:04:21.800 --> 00:04:23.440
with that kind of life?

00:04:25.680 --> 00:04:26.700
Well?

00:04:33.070 --> 00:04:34.740
It seems I've made a big mistake.

00:04:36.900 --> 00:04:38.300
See you later!

00:04:54.610 --> 00:04:57.060
As a traveling adventurer, I can at least do this much!

00:05:16.950 --> 00:05:20.090
H-How awful! I feel sick!

00:05:20.090 --> 00:05:23.130
I think I'm starting to hallucinate!

00:05:35.610 --> 00:05:37.070
There is no mistake!

00:05:37.070 --> 00:05:41.030
The young men who came by the main road spotted someone matching Leina's description.

00:05:42.600 --> 00:05:43.840
I will travel alongside you.

00:05:43.840 --> 00:05:47.250
That would bring shame to the Count. You cannot accompany me.

00:05:47.250 --> 00:05:48.150
Will you use force?

00:05:48.460 --> 00:05:51.320
If talking isn't enough, then it will come to that.

00:05:56.400 --> 00:05:58.640
Lightning General Claudette.

00:05:59.310 --> 00:06:01.090
It's finally time!

00:06:01.090 --> 00:06:03.870
Nanael can't control her excitement!

00:06:16.440 --> 00:06:17.880
<i>It's raining...</i>

00:06:17.880 --> 00:06:19.600
<i>and she has run away again.</i>

00:06:19.600 --> 00:06:21.150
<i>It's the same as that day...</i>

00:06:21.800 --> 00:06:23.110
Don't let go of my hand!

00:06:23.390 --> 00:06:25.980
OK, Claudette!

00:06:35.090 --> 00:06:39.240
I knew that you would come and save me, Onee-sama.

00:06:39.240 --> 00:06:41.350
That's why I wasn't crying.

00:06:41.810 --> 00:06:42.650
Is that so?

00:06:43.840 --> 00:06:46.480
You know, I really love you, Onee-sama.

00:06:48.580 --> 00:06:50.340
Leina-sama has been returned!

00:06:50.790 --> 00:06:52.780
Report this to the Count at once!

00:06:52.780 --> 00:06:54.850
Start up the fire! Hurry!

00:06:58.080 --> 00:06:59.480
Thank goodness you're okay!

00:06:59.480 --> 00:07:03.000
Do you know just how worried the Count was?

00:07:03.000 --> 00:07:05.790
You should never leave the house without permission.

00:07:08.300 --> 00:07:10.600
I bruised it went I fell from the castle wall.

00:07:10.600 --> 00:07:12.360
Anyone! Bring some bandages!

00:07:12.360 --> 00:07:14.540
Onee-sama saved me.

00:07:15.500 --> 00:07:19.120
How could something so terrible happen? If the Count sees this...

00:07:19.120 --> 00:07:21.710
Hurry! Bring the bandages to fix this wound!

00:07:38.200 --> 00:07:40.000
What beautiful flowers...

00:07:40.980 --> 00:07:43.700
And such kind flowers, as well.

00:07:55.180 --> 00:07:56.710
<i>On that day...</i>

00:07:56.710 --> 00:08:03.240
<i>My father stood before me once again, unable to express his true feelings.</i>

00:08:05.140 --> 00:08:07.070
<i>I was loved by my father.</i>

00:08:07.930 --> 00:08:09.730
<i>If I just believed that...</i>

00:08:10.860 --> 00:08:16.470
<i>If I just continued to believe that someday, we could smile together, then...</i>

00:08:17.580 --> 00:08:21.180
<i>Am I truly a flower that will wither in the shadows no matter what?</i>

00:08:33.260 --> 00:08:35.060
Mushrooms are scary...

00:08:35.060 --> 00:08:36.070
Mushrooms...

00:08:36.590 --> 00:08:41.740
Drops of water fall on the mat~...

00:08:41.740 --> 00:08:45.110
The red flowers are{fscx200}-

00:08:45.110 --> 00:08:46.290
W-who?

00:08:46.830 --> 00:08:49.030
An angelic visitor!

00:08:51.230 --> 00:08:53.960
I see. That must have been difficult for you.

00:08:54.190 --> 00:08:59.790
I've eaten them before, but this one felt strangely different from what I am used to.

00:09:01.050 --> 00:09:02.890
For times like these, take this!

00:09:03.410 --> 00:09:05.350
Angel resin, holy milk!

00:09:05.570 --> 00:09:10.010
If a person drinks it, it will cure headaches, muscle aches, stomach aches and all sorts of other aches! {she's talking about cramps lol}

00:09:10.010 --> 00:09:15.280
It also helps cure things like anemia, menstrual irregularity, and sensitivity to cold!

00:09:16.260 --> 00:09:18.270
I don't need the explanation, just hurry up and{fscx200}-

00:09:18.270 --> 00:09:19.950
Yes! It would be my pleasure!

00:09:19.950 --> 00:09:23.460
I'll sell it right now for a discount! Only 10 gold coins!

00:09:23.460 --> 00:09:24.390
Eh?

00:09:24.540 --> 00:09:27.580
That was a joke! Just a joke!

00:09:28.360 --> 00:09:29.870
Well, here you go!

00:09:31.070 --> 00:09:33.150
There's no need to thank me!

00:09:33.150 --> 00:09:36.240
Because helping those in need is the duty of an angel.

00:09:36.390 --> 00:09:41.140
<i>I finally got my chance... as if I would let a stomach ache stop me!</i>

00:09:52.180 --> 00:09:55.230
What the hell are you doing to a divine angel, you bitch!?

00:10:00.780 --> 00:10:03.160
Just kidding! It's an angel joke!

00:10:05.160 --> 00:10:07.540
Claudette, hurry up and come!

00:10:07.960 --> 00:10:10.960
Risty, Risty, Risty...

00:10:10.960 --> 00:10:12.460
No records of any battles.

00:10:12.780 --> 00:10:15.410
It seems that she has yet to fight in any.

00:10:15.410 --> 00:10:16.270
I see.

00:10:17.230 --> 00:10:20.690
Well, Queen's Blade broadcasts throughout the entire continent,

00:10:20.690 --> 00:10:22.800
so I think you would have heard about it.

00:10:24.370 --> 00:10:25.260
Yeah, that's true.

00:10:29.290 --> 00:10:30.640
You're leaving already?

00:10:31.740 --> 00:10:36.220
No... this is... um... that's right!

00:10:36.220 --> 00:10:40.320
It's time for Nanael's Queen's Blade Ask Anything Corner!

00:10:40.610 --> 00:10:41.250
Huh?

00:10:41.250 --> 00:10:44.870
As a special favor, you can ask anything you want, and I will answer!

00:10:44.870 --> 00:10:47.290
You're interested in Queen's Blade, right?

00:10:47.290 --> 00:10:47.950
Not at all.

00:10:48.290 --> 00:10:51.380
Huh? But this is Queen's Blade, you know!

00:10:51.380 --> 00:10:54.460
It's a festival that only happens every four years, you know. It decides the Queen, you know!

00:10:55.300 --> 00:10:57.970
Sorry, but I'm really not interested.

00:10:57.970 --> 00:11:00.590
Then why did you ask me those things about the battle results?

00:11:01.110 --> 00:11:03.950
It's because Risty is an important person to me.

00:11:04.600 --> 00:11:05.710
How unclean!

00:11:05.710 --> 00:11:06.800
How can I put this...

00:11:07.840 --> 00:11:09.770
I've never met a person like her.

00:11:11.220 --> 00:11:15.710
Risty is a person that steps through life carefully, overcoming any hardships she comes across.

00:11:15.710 --> 00:11:18.690
She was the first person to see the real me.

00:11:21.160 --> 00:11:23.360
I can't accept us being apart.

00:11:23.830 --> 00:11:24.740
That's why...

00:11:25.600 --> 00:11:27.070
Thanks for the milk.

00:11:27.070 --> 00:11:29.830
Maybe we will meet each other again somewhere. Good luck with your travels!

00:11:29.830 --> 00:11:33.500
I'm sorry, but I don't think this will be a nice journey.

00:11:33.500 --> 00:11:34.850
Not for you, at least...

00:11:55.530 --> 00:11:56.490
Onee-sama.

00:11:58.000 --> 00:11:59.670
You came this far?

00:12:02.940 --> 00:12:04.270
Are you accomplices?

00:12:04.270 --> 00:12:05.510
Who knows?

00:12:05.510 --> 00:12:07.360
We're returning to the castle.

00:12:07.360 --> 00:12:08.160
I don't want to.

00:12:08.720 --> 00:12:10.760
I won't return to the castle anymore.

00:12:10.760 --> 00:12:12.450
I won't just follow my fathers orders!

00:12:12.960 --> 00:12:16.790
Because I... I want to find the limits of my own strength!

00:12:18.470 --> 00:12:21.670
During your journey, you have picked up the practices of thieves.

00:12:21.670 --> 00:12:24.420
Will you make your lineage worse than a commoner's?

00:12:25.100 --> 00:12:27.630
You are truly a disgrace to the Bansu name!

00:12:27.630 --> 00:12:28.470
Feel thy shame!

00:12:29.700 --> 00:12:32.180
I will live to the fullest, without my title.

00:12:32.570 --> 00:12:35.920
I will beat that nonsense out of you, here and now!

00:12:37.970 --> 00:12:40.500
I am Lightning General Claudette.

00:12:40.500 --> 00:12:43.210
Legitimate heir to the Bansu family,

00:12:43.210 --> 00:12:45.660
Leina Bansu, I will make you my opponent.

00:12:45.660 --> 00:12:47.110
Let us fight to our hearts' content!

00:12:47.440 --> 00:12:49.930
So you're going to fight me, no matter what?

00:12:49.930 --> 00:12:51.510
Just a second!

00:12:51.510 --> 00:12:54.080
Nanael has been entrusted with this battle!

00:12:54.510 --> 00:12:57.000
O Lord in heaven, guide us to the afterlife!

00:12:58.840 --> 00:12:59.710
What is this?

00:13:02.910 --> 00:13:04.000
It started!

00:13:04.000 --> 00:13:06.160
So early in the morning...

00:13:07.980 --> 00:13:10.850
This warrior's name is the Lightning General, Claudette.

00:13:10.850 --> 00:13:16.230
And the other is... um... I guess this is fine. Vagrant warrior, Leina!

00:13:17.070 --> 00:13:19.030
Just how did this happen?

00:13:19.470 --> 00:13:20.980
Those fools...

00:13:23.940 --> 00:13:24.920
Onee-chan...

00:13:26.250 --> 00:13:27.810
Oh, Leina...

00:13:27.810 --> 00:13:29.950
I want to be by your side, right now!

00:13:32.300 --> 00:13:34.190
It's come, it's come, it's come!

00:13:34.190 --> 00:13:38.420
If no one participates in Queen's Blade, I'll just have to do it myself!

00:13:38.700 --> 00:13:41.740
Nanael is so smart! The greatest!

00:13:42.770 --> 00:13:46.340
<i>How tedious! This angel is with Queen's Blade...</i>

00:13:46.770 --> 00:13:48.760
I will show you my resolution!

00:13:49.800 --> 00:13:52.680
Queen's Blade has begun, Tomoe-sama.

00:13:53.880 --> 00:13:54.820
Yes.

00:13:54.820 --> 00:13:57.040
Lightning General Claudette.

00:13:57.040 --> 00:13:59.330
She will very likely be my opponent.

00:13:59.330 --> 00:14:02.400
I must carve the way she fights into my memory.

00:14:03.020 --> 00:14:06.640
It looks like we don't even need to know the name of the other warrior, though.

00:14:08.200 --> 00:14:12.580
Leina, I will say it once more. Return to the castle with me.

00:14:27.890 --> 00:14:31.300
<i>I can't let the recognized heir be disgraced like this.</i>

00:14:31.850 --> 00:14:33.740
Hurry up and go at it!

00:14:33.740 --> 00:14:35.560
Where is your fighting spirit?

00:14:36.030 --> 00:14:40.180
Leina, I will aim for you again in a place where that angel isn't present.

00:14:40.180 --> 00:14:42.850
Until then, continue to be free.

00:14:43.270 --> 00:14:44.850
Cut it out!

00:14:44.850 --> 00:14:46.960
You are always like that, Onee-sama.

00:14:46.960 --> 00:14:51.780
Looking down on my feelings with that triumphant expression...

00:14:52.770 --> 00:14:55.300
Onee-sama saved me, you know?

00:14:55.300 --> 00:14:56.230
I see.

00:14:56.720 --> 00:14:59.990
Daddy, why are you never kind to Onee-sama?

00:15:01.770 --> 00:15:03.240
You know, I...

00:15:03.240 --> 00:15:05.340
I love Onee-sama!

00:15:06.680 --> 00:15:08.880
I gave her a flower.

00:15:08.880 --> 00:15:10.970
One of the most beautiful blue roses.

00:15:11.420 --> 00:15:13.240
It was her reward for saving me!

00:15:13.550 --> 00:15:14.370
I see.

00:15:15.240 --> 00:15:18.310
Onee-sama, you don't even understand Father's true feelings!

00:15:22.420 --> 00:15:25.400
It's beautiful. It suits you, Clo.

00:15:32.980 --> 00:15:36.820
It is a beautiful flower. You should treasure it.

00:15:39.710 --> 00:15:43.070
You will never betray me.

00:15:43.070 --> 00:15:44.790
I believe in you.

00:15:50.920 --> 00:15:53.680
Why do you put up that composed expression?

00:15:54.120 --> 00:15:57.680
Is that the reason Father treated you so coldly?

00:15:58.560 --> 00:15:59.680
A person like that...

00:16:01.850 --> 00:16:02.930
Why?

00:16:10.170 --> 00:16:13.030
While I was on my journey, I was always thinking.

00:16:13.750 --> 00:16:16.550
What does Father plan to do from now on?

00:16:17.240 --> 00:16:19.880
Why doesn't he save the starving children?

00:16:21.480 --> 00:16:23.360
Why do I have to be the heiress?

00:16:24.240 --> 00:16:25.670
I don't understand it at all!

00:16:26.460 --> 00:16:28.000
Explain it, Onee-sama!

00:16:28.970 --> 00:16:29.930
Why?

00:16:31.150 --> 00:16:32.800
Even though it's you...

00:16:33.730 --> 00:16:35.760
Why do you obey the order to protect me?

00:16:41.510 --> 00:16:43.250
Even though you have such strength...

00:16:48.960 --> 00:16:50.490
For your sake?

00:16:50.890 --> 00:16:52.490
Don't get the wrong idea.

00:16:52.490 --> 00:16:54.280
I do everything for the sake of the Bansu family.

00:16:54.580 --> 00:16:56.950
Ah! That was a great counterattack!

00:16:57.520 --> 00:16:59.230
Did you see that?

00:16:59.230 --> 00:17:02.620
That was an incredible technique. One of the most powerful counterattacks!

00:17:05.050 --> 00:17:07.540
How long do you intend to act like a child?

00:17:08.280 --> 00:17:09.900
You are despicable, Leina.

00:17:12.230 --> 00:17:13.130
Very well...

00:17:14.610 --> 00:17:17.550
I shall show you my serious side.

00:17:19.350 --> 00:17:23.430
This might be pointless to say, but I always felt my father's love.

00:17:24.500 --> 00:17:26.310
Remember that!

00:17:39.970 --> 00:17:42.930
Thunderclap Strike!

00:18:37.680 --> 00:18:40.080
It's not... over yet...

00:18:40.790 --> 00:18:42.530
This battle...

00:18:42.530 --> 00:18:44.730
She's watching it from somewhere...

00:18:44.730 --> 00:18:45.550
From somewhere...

00:18:45.750 --> 00:18:47.460
It's over already!

00:18:47.460 --> 00:18:51.480
It's your loss. No matter how you look at it, it's a complete defeat.

00:18:51.890 --> 00:18:54.310
I can still go on...

00:18:55.040 --> 00:18:55.910
Risty...

00:19:10.560 --> 00:19:12.230
Really...

00:19:12.230 --> 00:19:14.630
That was a waste of time.

00:19:15.600 --> 00:19:18.360
It seemed to me like there was some sort of situation going on between them.

00:19:20.470 --> 00:19:24.070
Hm? To go about worrying over other peoples' relationships...

00:19:24.070 --> 00:19:26.070
You sure are caring, Tomoe-sama.

00:19:26.070 --> 00:19:27.890
T-That was just a slip of the tongue.

00:19:28.300 --> 00:19:29.560
Leina!

00:20:05.020 --> 00:20:06.440
Don't let go of my hand!

00:20:07.340 --> 00:20:08.210
Let go of me!

00:20:09.870 --> 00:20:11.560
Leave me alone already!

00:20:11.560 --> 00:20:12.850
If you fall, you'll die.

00:20:13.730 --> 00:20:19.070
If you care about my feelings even the slightest bit, just let go!

00:20:19.470 --> 00:20:20.150
Please!

00:20:20.450 --> 00:20:22.540
Throwing your life away like that...

00:20:22.540 --> 00:20:23.490
That's ridiculous!

00:20:24.100 --> 00:20:27.240
Let me be free, Onee-sama.

00:20:27.490 --> 00:20:28.660
Leina!

00:20:29.380 --> 00:20:31.120
Claudette...

00:20:31.850 --> 00:20:32.580
I love you.

00:20:51.680 --> 00:20:52.990
<i>Claudette...</i>

00:21:09.840 --> 00:21:11.870
I didn't think this would happen...

00:21:32.720 --> 00:21:34.450
<i>I already knew...</i>

00:21:35.730 --> 00:21:38.360
<i>My father's smile...</i>

00:21:38.360 --> 00:21:40.840
<i>wasn't meant for me...</i>

00:23:14.290 --> 00:23:15.830
Ah, hello.

00:23:15.830 --> 00:23:18.250
Everything got kind of messed up.

00:23:18.250 --> 00:23:21.920
Nanael is trying her best, so how could everything be ruined like this?

00:23:21.920 --> 00:23:23.920
Ah~ this is all such a pain! It really bothers me!

00:23:23.920 --> 00:23:26.170
They should just sort everything more straight.

00:23:26.170 --> 00:23:30.700
Because of this, the other angels are going to give me a hard time.

00:23:30.700 --> 00:23:32.080
They'll all be angry with me!

00:23:32.080 --> 00:23:35.280
They already treat me badly enough.

00:23:35.280 --> 00:23:37.560
But next time, I'll show them I can do it!

00:23:37.560 --> 00:23:39.680
Next time: Resurrected Curse ~ The Ancient Princess!

00:23:39.680 --> 00:23:43.400
Let's have everything be explained with battle!
